Fable 5.2 can work all weekend without you. Getting the most out of it means changing how you work.

.@kieranklaassen started building a video editor on a day off. Three days later, Everycut was live—with editing, visual effects, audio mixing, and an AI agent that could operate it. A week later, we ran a company-wide show-and-tell using it.

@hammer_mt gave it roughly 1,400 Slack messages and notes from 127 meetings. Without him outlining the argument first, it produced a cited account of his thinking, flagged 38 places where he’d contradicted himself, and made an explainer video. …
